# Spring Boot Weather API

REST API developed with Spring Boot that retrieves current
weather information for a given city.

## Technologies
- Java 21
- Spring Boot
- Spring Web / RestClient
- Maven
- Open-Meteo API

## Features
- City geocoding
- Current temperature
- Current humidity
- Input validation
- Custom exception handling
- Global exception handler

## Endpoint

GET /api/weather?city=Tunis